    <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#fca5a5;font-weight:bold;">🚧 Safety and Ethics Notes (Classroom and Field Visits)</p>
    <div>
    <ul style="margin:6px 0;padding-left:22px;">
    <li>Follow workshop rules and wear the right protective clothing at all times.</li>
    <li>Check ladders, steps and stands before use, and never work at height alone.</li>
    <li>Read the label and hazard symbol before using any substance; never taste or sniff chemicals.</li>
    <li>Report spills, damaged equipment and injuries to the teacher at once.</li>
    </ul>
