    <p><strong>Self-exploration</strong> is finding out about yourself — your talents, abilities, interests, values and personality. A <strong>talent</strong> is a natural gift, such as a good singing voice. An <strong>ability</strong> is a skill you can do well, often built through learning, such as typing or welding. Both can be developed.</p>
